{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bdf28651-d22f-841d-9a32-af45f63c3e01",
  "created_at": "2026-02-05T13:29:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivone Tavares",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:25:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:25:30-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, yes, hello. I'm calling about the snow, well, the parking ban. When does it lift? I've been hearing different things and I don't want to move my car too early or too late."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:25:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, let me pull that up. Are you on a street that's under the ban, or you just want to know the general rule?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:25:54-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I'm at 23 Ruggles Avenue, up on the Hill. There's no driveway, so I park on the street, and, well, I had to leave the car down by the church a couple nights."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:26:07-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 23 Ruggles, got it. [pause] So the way it works, the ban stays on until the city announces it's lifted. Usually that's once the plows have made it through and the streets are cleared curb to curb. Is there a storm you're asking about right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:26:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, it's just a regular cold week, the snow from before is still piled up. I just want to know if it's still in effect today or not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:26:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Let me check what's posted. [pause] Okay, I'm showing the ban isn't active today. It's been lifted. So you can park on Ruggles as normal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:26:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Good. Um, so that's lifted as of now, not like tonight at some hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:26:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct, it's off as of now. If another one's called, it goes out on the city's alerts and the website, and you'd get a few hours' notice as a rule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:27:06-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Well, and the other thing, um, the street's got ice, a lot of it, in front of the house and down the slope. Can I get sand? Do you bring it, or do I come get it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:27:21-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sand, okay, writing that down. We can put in a request for a truck to sand the hill, and there's also usually a sand pile residents can scoop from for their own walkways. Which one are you after, the street or your walk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:27:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the street, mostly. The slope is bad. I'm a renter so I don't, um, have a lot of, you know, a way to haul sand anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:27:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. So street sanding, 23 Ruggles Avenue, icy slope. Is it just in front of your house or the whole block?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:27:57-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the whole stretch from the corner to about my house. The cars slide when they come up. I've been scraping into the curb and I'm, um, I'm budgeting for a new set of tires already, honestly, so I'd like to not slide into anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:28:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Okay, I've got the whole stretch from the corner up past 23. I'll send that to the crew as a sanding request. Do you want a call back, or is that good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:28:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, yes, a call back would be fine. It's 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:28:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one eight five, got it. And it's Ivone, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:28:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Ivone Tavares. T-A-V-A-R-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:28:39-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, Ms. Tavares. Sanding is usually done in the afternoon or by the next morning on the hills, so you should see a truck today or early tomorrow. If it's not done by then, call back and mention this request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:28:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine. So, parking's allowed today, and sand is requested. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:28:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:29:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, stay warm."
    }
  ],
